# warnings

## INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT

```text
[INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT] target.js is dynamically imported by main.js but also statically imported by main.js, dynamic import will not move module into another chunk.

```

# Assets

## barrel.js

```js
// HIDDEN [\0rolldown/runtime.js]
// barrel.js
var barrel_exports = /* @__PURE__ */ __exportAll({}, 2);
import * as import_node_path from "node:path";
__reExport(barrel_exports, import_node_path);
export { __exportAll as n, __reExport as r, barrel_exports as t };

```

## live.js

```js
import { n as __exportAll, r as __reExport, t as barrel_exports } from "./barrel.js";
export * from "node:path";
__reExport(/* @__PURE__ */ __exportAll({}, 2), barrel_exports);

```

## main.js

```js
import { n as __exportAll, r as __reExport, t as barrel_exports } from "./barrel.js";
// target.js
var target_exports = /* @__PURE__ */ __exportAll({ x: () => 1 }, 2);
__reExport(target_exports, barrel_exports);
const x = 1;
// main.js
const loaded = Promise.resolve().then(() => target_exports);
export { loaded, x };

```
